{"id":533,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Gurdurr excels at demolition—construction is not its forte. In any case, there’s skill in the way this Pokémon wields its metal beam."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It shows off its muscles to Machoke and other Gurdurr. If it fails to measure up to the other Pokémon, it lies low for a little while."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Black"],"text":"This Pokémon is so muscular and strongly built that even a group of wrestlers could not make it budge an inch."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings."},{"games":["White"],"text":"They strengthen their bodies by carrying steel beams. They show off their big muscles to their friends."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Guts","hidden":false,"description":"It's so gutsy that having a status condition boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat."},{"name":"Sheer Force","hidden":false,"description":"Removes any additional effects from the Pokémon's moves, but increases the moves' power."},{"name":"Iron Fist","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up punching moves."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":2,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":532,"name":"Timburr","condition":null,"children":[{"id":533,"name":"Gurdurr","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[{"id":534,"name":"Conkeldurr","condition":"Trade","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,43],[1,67],[1,88],[12,116],[16,339],[20,157],[24,21],[30,184],[36,223],[42,359],[48,444],[54,276],[60,264]],"machine":[280,339,370,811,174,91,38,409,203,263,7,374,411,264,447,270,667,8,282,67,490,398,182,240,156,179,157,317,184,214,479,444,164,241,36,269,851,168,9],"egg":[68,432,197,183,469],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-126","name":"Gurdurr","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"126","artist":"Souic